GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "C1F9E95C38986BC8"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{3207D4867B3F97A2}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "1. SITUATION"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces"\
     ""\
     "Enemy mechanized infantry units advancing from the west in company strength. Intelligence indicates they have light armored support and reconnaissance elements moving ahead of the main force. Enemy intent is to seize control of Simon’s Woods and secure key roadways leading east."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces"\
     ""\
     "Adjacent units to the north and south are conducting similar delay operations to shape the battlefield. Battalion HQ is positioned east of Simon’s Woods. BTN Mortar Section (51) located at 074 043 have been assigned to us. OP101 has been established with defensive obstacles, including minefields and an abatis. Two AI Squads are forward deployed to the West."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D458D6E9E8BC41E5}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "CURRENT SITUATION"
     m_sContent "We heard 320 COY being engaged to our immediate South a few minutes ago, and 330 COY to our North engaging enemy positions in the town of Figari. Our COY 310 have been proving the route and intend to now march along route 'ASR Toyota'. Earlier today 314 PLT's lead two squads have been rendered combat ineffective due to Canadian ambushes and as such 315  SQD from 314 PLT will be attached to our platoon. We are now the lead platoon in the formation. "\
     ""\
     "Attached Units:"\
     "542 - T72A MBT "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{28136BE483767E5D}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "The scenario represents a Cold War-era hypothetical engagement between a Soviet Motorized Infantry force and a Canadian Infantry unit executing a delaying action in Simon's Wood, a forested terrain."\
     "Scenario Overview:"\
     "Setting: A mixed forest and open terrain area (Simon's Wood), representing Central Europe during a NATO-Warsaw Pact conflict."\
     "Mission: The Soviet Motorized Infantry force is tasked with attacking and clearing a route for follow on forces. The Canadian Infantry force is conducting a delaying action, engaging Soviet forces to slow their advance before retreating to secondary positions."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5E6D00B670345D6E}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "ENEMY"
     m_sContent "Enemy forces opposing our advancement are primarily Canadian motrized units conducting defensive and delaying operations, in an estimated Bataillon minus strength in the vicinity of Figari."\
     "	"\
     "They are equipped with battle rifles, machineguns, recoiless rifles."\
     "	"\
     "The enemy is attempting to delay our forward elements movement along parallel routes to disrupt and canalize our advance. We expect the enemy to attempt small unit ambushes and delaying actions along the route, they have already ambushed elements our sister company to our north, knocking out one of their BTRs. We expect enemy obstacles along the dirt tracks and roads."\
     ""\
     "Forward elements of our COY have identified several enemy AT minefields with in the forrest and roads their approximate location is marked. "\
     "	"\
     "Confirmed enemy locations:"\
     "	"\
     "Houses South of OP101"\
     "Obstacle: Near OP-101."\
     "	"\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{FE78F1F12204E156}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "2. MISSION"
     m_sContent "The Canadian Platoon will conduct a delay and retreat operation in the vicinity of Simon’s Woods to impede enemy advance, disrupt their movement, and force them into engagement under unfavorable conditions. COMMAND have requested that enemy vehicles to be destroyed specifically, specially MBTs."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EFF4E8A22532603E}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "3. EXECUTION"
     m_sContent "a. Commander’s Intent"\
     ""\
     "Delay enemy advance by forcing them into pre-prepared engagement zones, utilizing defensive obstacles and ambushes, and then withdrawing in good order to Phase Line Bravo without excessive casualties. Priortize destruction of enemy vehicles. "\
     ""\
     "b. Concept of Operations"\
     ""\
     "Phase 1: Utilize prepared defensive positions, including mines and abatis, to delay and channel the enemy into pre-designated fire zones."\
     ""\
     "Phase 2 (Fallback to Simon’s Woods): Conduct a fighting withdrawal for 35 minutes with a focus on destruction of enemy vehicles using bounding overwatch, inflicting maximum damage while maintaining cohesion."\
     ""\
     "Phase 3 (Extraction): Link up with freindly elements from our COY at the extraction point North East of Simon's Woods."\
     ""\
     "c. Coordinating Instructions"\
     ""\
     "Primary withdrawal signal: Green flare."\
     "No unit is to withdraw without direct order from platoon command."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{562670712D571814}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "COMPANY ORDER"
     m_sContent "I order:"\
     "	"\
     "310 COY to prove the route eastward along ASR TOYOTA with the task to defeat any enemy forces and identify any obstacles along the route to allow for the rest of the battalion to continue without incident, while remaining combat effective."\
     "	"\
     "a) Tasks to subordinate units:"\
     "	"\
     "310 to conduct dismounted sweep along ASR TOYOTA, securing at least 75 meters to either side of the track and screening to the front and flanks of the vehicles. 310 vehicles to provide fire support to destroy any enemy forces identified from along RT Klaus itself."\
     "	"\
     "b) Tasks to artillery and other units:"\
     "	"\
     "310 Company mortars currently resupplying, and will not be available. "\
     "	"\
     "c) Tasks to NBC defense:"\
     "	"\
     "No NBC weapons use is expected by the enemy. All elements shall report any observed use of NBC weapons via radio immediately."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{9C7461AC850FC58A}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "4. SUSTAINMENT"
     m_sContent "1x M151A1 Jeep with:"\
     "6x C4 Explosives"\
     "2x Clackers (100m Range)"\
     ""\
     "Mortars:"\
     "400x HE Rounds"\
     "600x Smoke Rounds"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{563C1E588C2D48E9}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "SIGNALS"
     m_sContent "311 (You) PLT 42.0"\
     "314 PLT 43.0"\
     "317 PLT 44.0"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E3EC45AE2B33036F}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "5. COMMAND AND SIGNAL"
     m_sContent "Primary Communications: Platoon Net (Freq 40.500 MHz)"\
     "Codeword for Immediate Withdrawal: \"Maple\""\
     "Challenge/Password: \"North\" / \"True\""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6F68FB8CACD4AE0A}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
     m_sContent "311(+) is to CLEAR along ASR TOYOTA to the east and sieze OP-101. Vehicles are to remain down ASR Toyota due to high risk of vehicles loss deviating from ASR Toyota accordding to forward elements."\
     "	"\
     "Current location:"\
     ""\
     "Marked on map with Motroized PLT HQ Marker"\
     "	"\
     "Marching Roads:"\
     "	"\
     "'ASR Toyota'."\
     "	"\
     "Point of Observation:"\
     "	"\
     "OP-101, to be reached within 40 minutes. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7E66B7F5C603C181}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "METREP"
     m_sContent "First light: 05:48hr"\
     "	"\
     "Last light: 18:33hr"\
     "	"\
     "Percent illumination: 65%"\
     "	"\
